          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "സമ്മതിക്കുക (sammatikkuka) is built from Sanskrit saṁmata, \"agreed, approved\" (CDIAL 12973), with the Malayalam verb ending -ിക്കുക. It is the verb of സമ്മതം, consent."
            }
          ]
        },
